WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:07.982
"Jim, here's your sleeping bag. Have fun!" Mom said.

2
00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:11.687
"See you tomorrow, Mom," I said.

3
00:00:11.688 --> 00:00:18.624
I was having a sleepover at Steve's house. It was my first one.

4
00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:23.687
"Hi Jim!" Steve was waiting for me at the door.

5
00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:26.079
"Let's put your stuff in my room.

6
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.786
Then we can go outside to rollerblade."

7
00:00:28.787 --> 00:00:33.041
"Sounds great!" I said.

8
00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:38.401
Steve brought me upstairs.

9
00:00:38.402 --> 00:00:42.852
In his room he had lots of cool toys.

10
00:00:42.853 --> 00:00:49.765
He also had a white guinea pig named Ghost.

11
00:00:49.766 --> 00:00:54.097
Soon we were rollerblading outside.

12
00:00:54.098 --> 00:00:58.158
"Watch this spin," Steve said.

13
00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:04.757
"Nice move. Watch me jump," I said.

14
00:01:04.758 --> 00:01:15.970
Steve's mom called us inside for dinner. "Time for pizza, boys!"

15
00:01:15.971 --> 00:01:22.599
After dinner we played video games. Then we went to bed.

16
00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:30.010
Steve's mom turned off the lights. "Don't stay up too late. Good night."

17
00:01:30.011 --> 00:01:35.349
"Good night," we said. But we couldn't sleep.

18
00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:41.914
We laughed and told spooky stories until Steve's mom came back.

19
00:01:41.915 --> 00:01:50.562
"Boys," she said. "It's getting late. Go to sleep, please."

20
00:01:50.563 --> 00:01:54.764
"Okay," we said.

21
00:01:54.765 --> 00:02:02.792
For a while we were quiet. Then— thump!

22
00:02:02.793 --> 00:02:06.105
Bump! "What was that?" I whispered.

23
00:02:06.106 --> 00:02:10.890
"I don't know." Steve sounded scared too.

24
00:02:10.891 --> 00:02:13.819
We heard the sounds again.

25
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:19.646
"I think there's a monster in the closet!" I said.

26
00:02:19.647 --> 00:02:24.328
"Oh no!" Steve pulled his blanket over his head.

27
00:02:24.329 --> 00:02:27.381
I hid under my blanket too.

28
00:02:27.382 --> 00:02:29.680
Thump! Bump!

29
00:02:29.681 --> 00:02:37.344
Steve stayed under the covers, hiding. "I want my mommy!"

30
00:02:37.345 --> 00:02:43.571
Soon it was quiet again. Slowly I peeked out.

31
00:02:43.572 --> 00:02:47.385
Across the room something was moving!

32
00:02:47.386 --> 00:02:52.720
I was about to scream—until I realized something.

33
00:02:52.721 --> 00:03:01.701
"Guess what, Steve. It's not a monster. It's Ghost!"

34
00:03:01.702 --> 00:03:06.790
Steve pulled the covers tighter. "A ghost?"

35
00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:11.344
I burst into laughter.

36
00:03:11.345 --> 00:03:16.147
"Not a ghost. It's Ghost.

37
00:03:16.148 --> 00:03:20.540
Your guinea pig escaped from his cage!"

38
00:03:20.541 --> 00:03:26.251
Steve laughed too.

39
00:03:26.252 --> 00:03:29.152
He got up and put Ghost back.

40
00:03:29.153 --> 00:03:32.945
Soon we were both asleep.

41
00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:37.948
The next morning my mom picked me up. "Did you have fun?"

42
00:03:37.949 --> 00:03:43.039
"Yep!" I said. "We saw a ghost!"

43
00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:47.406
"What?" Mom said.

44
00:03:47.407 --> 00:03:51.531
I told her about Steve's guinea pig, and she laughed.

45
00:03:51.532 --> 00:03:55.406
Then we made plans for my second sleepover.

46
00:03:55.407 --> 00:04:01.953
Next weekend Steve was coming to my house!

